      "source": [
        "### Leakage checks (before any modelling)\n",
        "\n",
        "These checks make sure the test set is genuinely unseen:\n",
        "* train and test rows are different rows (no shared index),\n",
        "* the target and `Text` are not among the features,\n",
        "* no test row has an identical feature combination in the training set (duplicate leakage)."
      ]
