        "## 13. Random Forest Feature Importance\n",
        "\n",
        "After one-hot encoding, `Employment_Status` becomes several columns, so the names are taken from the fitted preprocessor via `get_feature_names_out()` to keep labels aligned with the importance values.\n",
        "\n",
        "Feature importance shows how much each feature helped the trained forest reduce impurity. It tells us what *this model* relied on. It does **not** prove that a feature *causes* approval."
      ]
    },
