        "\n",
        "* **Dataset size:** 24,000 loan applications (19,200 train / 4,800 test), 5 structured features used\n",
        "* **Problem type:** Supervised binary classification (`Approved` vs `Rejected`), imbalanced (≈ 83.6 % / 16.4 %)\n",
